invariant: INV-44
file: p384_wide_field.c
catches: p384_equiv_test
reason: the Montgomery product's last subtraction looks at the low six
  words and not at the word above them, so a sum of 2^384 or more,
  which about half of all products have, is returned without its
  subtraction. bin/p384_equiv_test requires every product to be
  p384_field.c's.

--- old
    if (t[P384_WIDE_WORDS] || p384_wide_compare(t, mod->m) >= 0) {
--- new
    if (p384_wide_compare(t, mod->m) >= 0) {
